Changes from the original (Apache-2.0 §4(b)): renamed to Creatte Tool; new name, app id
(jp.creatte.creatte-tool), icons, wordmark, colours, rounded shapes and fonts; the twelve apps
shown under Creatte names; a Japanese interface added; the upstream release-feed API turned
off by default (GitHub only); links and self-update pointed at Creatte's own repository.

Trademarks. The ArtCraft name, wordmark, logo and "A" mark are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team.
They are not used in Creatte Tool: every ArtCraft brand file was removed (as the upstream brand
terms require of modified versions) and replaced with Creatte's own artwork. "ArtCraft" appears
