from. Creatte Tool is an independent product; it is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed
by the ArtCraft Team or Storyteller.

The apps Creatte Tool installs are, by default, the open-source upstream builds published at
https://github.com/storytold/<app> (PhotoCraft, VectorCraft, FilmCraft, LightCraft, PdfCraft,
EffectCraft, DesignCraft, WordCraft, DeckCraft, GridCraft, CADCraft, SoundCraft), MIT OR
